## Code Example

```javascript
class Pipeline {
  constructor() {
    this.steps = [];
  }
  register(step) {
    this.steps.push(step);
  }
  run(event) {
    return this.steps.reduce((e, s) => s(e), event);
  }
}

// Usage: extend without touching core
